":\"*\",\"action\":\"allow\",\"pattern\":\"*\"} evaluated\n"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Вижу проблему! Opencode использует `kimi-for-coding` вместо нашего `swarm-gateway`. Значит opencode не видит наш провайдер.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "tool_dBP4Bilc89n1H49dQQgOChup", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "bash", "arguments": "{\"command\":\"# Проверяем весь конфиг целиком\\ncat ~/.config/opencode/opencode.json | grep -A 20 '\\\"provider\\\"' | head -30\",\"description\":\"Check provider config\"}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "tool_dBP4Bilc89n1H49dQQgOChup", "content": "  \"provider\": {\n    \"ollama\": {\n      \"npm\": \"@ai-sdk/openai-compatible\",\n      \"name\": \"Ollama (local)\",\n      \"options\": {\n        \"baseURL\": \"http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1\"\n      },\n      \"models\": {\n        \"swarm\": {\n          \"name\": \"SWEN v3 Swarm (distributed)\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"lmstudioA1\": {\n      \"npm\": \"@ai-sdk/openai-compatible\",\n      \"name\": \"LM Studio (net)\",\n      \"options\": {\n        \"baseURL\": \"http://10.15.64.226:1234/v1\"\n      },\n      \"models\": {\n\n"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Ага! Конфиг **перезаписался** обратно на `ollama`! Opencode видимо перезаписал конфиг при старте. Давай проверим текущий конфиг полностью:", "tool_calls": [{"id": "tool_e7m3hcKmBa5l7p4ivsRxuMj8", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "read", "arguments": "{\"filePath\":\"/Users/alex/.config/opencode/opencode.json\"}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "tool_e7m3hcKmBa5l7p4ivsRxuMj8", "content": "<path>/Users/alex/.config/opencode/opencode.json</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: {\n2:   \"$schema\": \"https://opencode.ai/config.json\",\n3:   \"model\": \"ollama/swarm\",\n4:   \"small_model\": \"ollama/swarm\",\n5:   \"default_agent\": \"autonomous-swarm\",\n6:   \"provider\": {\n7:     \"ollama\": {\n8:       \"npm\": \"@ai-sdk/openai-compatible\",\n9:       \"name\": \"Ollama (local)\",\n10:       \"options\": {\n11:         \"baseURL\": \"http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1\"\n12:       },\n13:       \"models\": {\n14:         \"swarm\": {\n15:           \"name\": \"SWEN v3 Swarm (distributed)\"\n16:         }\n17:       }\n18:     },\n19:     \"lmstudioA1\": {\n20:       \"npm\": \"@ai-sdk/openai-compatible\",\n21:       \"name\": \"LM Studio (net)\",\n22:       \"options\": {\n23:         \"baseURL\": \"http://10.15.64.226:1234/v1\"\n24:       },\n25:       \"models\": {\n26: \n27:         \"gpt-oss-20b\": {\n28:           \"name\": \"gpt-oss-20b(net)\"\n29:         },\n30:         \"zai-org/glm-4.7-flash\": {\n31:           \"name\": \"glm-4.7-flash (net)\"\n32:         },\n33:         \"mistralai/devstral-small-2-2512\": {\n34:           \"name\": \"devstral-small-2-2512 (net)\"\n35:         },\n36:         \"DavidAU/GLM-4.7-Flash-Uncensored-Heretic-NEO-CODE-Imatrix-MAX-GGUF\": {\n37:           \"name\": \"GLM-4.7-Flash-Uncensored (net)\"\n38:         },\n39:         \"mradermacher/Qwen3-53B-A3B-2507-TOTAL-RECALL-v2-MASTER-CODER-i1-GGUF\": {\n40:           \"name\": \"Qwen3-53B-A3B-2507-TOTAL-RECALL-v2 (net)\"\n41:         },\n42:         \"mradermacher/Huihui-Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B-Instruct-abliterated-i1-GGUF\": {\n43:           \"name\": \"Huihui-Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B (net)\"\n44:         },\n45: \n46:         \"qwen/qwen3.5-9b\": {\n47:           \"name\": \"Qwen3.5-9B (net)\"\n48:         }\n49:       }\n50:     },\n51: \n52: \n53:     \"lmstudio\": {\n54:       \"npm\": \"@ai-sdk/openai-compatible\",\n55:       \"name\": \"LM Studio (local)\",\n56:       \"options\": {\n57:         \"baseURL\": \"http://127.0.0.1:1234/v1\"\n58:       },\n59:       \"models\": {\n60: \n61:         \"gpt-oss-20b\": {\n62:           \"name\": \"gpt-oss-20b(local)\"\n63:         },\n64: \n65:         \"Nerdsking/nerdsking-python-coder-3B-i\": {\n66:           \"name\": \"nerdsking-python-coder-3B-i(local)\"\n67:         },\n68: \n69:         \"ethanolivertroy/HackIDLE-NIST-Coder-v1.1-GGUF\": {\n70:           \"name\": \"HackIDLE-NIST-Coder-v1.1(local)\"\n71:         },\n72: \n73:         \"mradermacher/CodeV-SVA-no-think-no-dut-8B-i1-GGUF\": {\n74:           \"name\": \"CodeV-SVA-8b(local)\"\n75:         },\n76: \n77:         \"qwen/qwen3-vl-8b\": {\n78:           \"name\": \"qwen3-vl-8b(local)\"\n79:         },\n80: \n81:         \"nightmedia/Codeforce-metatune-gpt20b-q8-hi-mlx\":{\n82:           \"name\":\"Codeforce-metatune-gpt20b-q8-hi-mlx(local)\"}\n83:       }\n84:     }\n85:   },\n86:   \"agent\": {\n87:     \"autonomous-swarm\": {\n88:       \"description\": \"Autonomous Swarm — fully autonomous distributed AI swarm. No decision-making on opencode side. Simple passthrough: user query → swarm → answer. Swarm handles decomposition, worker selection, judging.\",\n89:       \"mode\": \"primary\",\n90:       \"permission\": {\n91:         \"edit\": \"allow\",\n92:         \"bash\": \"allow\",\n93:         \"read\": \"allow\",\n94:         \"glob\": \"allow\",\n95:         \"grep\": \"allow\",\n96:         \"swen3_ask\": \"allow\",\n97:         \"swen3_status\": \"allow\"\n98:       }\n99:     },\n100:     \"layered-swarm\": {\n101:       \"description\": \"Layered Swarm Agent — multi-layer distributed AI swarm. All operations delegated to worker pools (decomposition, execution, judging, final selection). No LLM on opencode side.\",\n102:       \"mode\": \"primary\",\n103:       \"permission\": {\n104:         \"edit\": \"allow\",\n105:         \"bash\": \"allow\",\n106:         \"read\": \"allow\",\n107:         \"glob\": \"allow\",\n108:         \"grep\": \"allow\",\n109:         \"swen3_ask\": \"allow\"\n110:       }\n111:     },\n112:     \"swarm-controller\": {\n113:       \"description\": \"Swarm Controller — primary agent for SWEN v3 distributed AI swarm. Analyzes tasks, selects optimal workers, decomposes complex queries, synthesizes answers.\",\n114:       \"mode\": \"primary\",\n115:       \"permission\": {\n116:         \"edit\": \"allow\",\n117:         \"bash\": \"allow\",\n118:         \"read\": \"allow\",\n119:         \"glob\": \"allow\",\n120:         \"grep\": \"allow\",\n121:         \"swen3_ask\": \"allow\"\n122:       }\n123:     },\n124:     \"swen3\": {\n125:       \"description\": \"Distributed AI swarm agent (SWEN v3). Routes questions to a parallel ensemble of LLM workers on Diana via Zenoh P2P mesh.\",\n126:       \"mode\": \"subagent\",\n127:       \"permission\": {\n128:         \"edit\": \"deny\",\n129:         \"bash\": \"deny\",\n130:         \"read\": \"allow\",\n131:         \"glob\": \"allow\",\n132:         \"grep\": \"allow\",\n133:         \"swen3_ask\": \"allow\"\n134:       }\n135:     }\n136:   }\n137: }\n\n(End of file - total 137 lines)\n</content>"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Конфиг **снова** перезаписался на `ollama`! Opencode видимо автоматически меняет конфиг. \n\nДавай попробуем другой подход — используем **существующий** провайдер `lmstudio` и просто изменим его `baseURL`:", "tool_calls": [{"id": "tool_oQLW5aF0WS8CIVayFtklWCQl", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "edit", "arguments": "{\"filePath\":\"/Users/alex/.config/opencode/opencode.json\",\"oldString\":\"    \\\"lmstudio\\\": {\\n      \\\"npm\\\": \\\"@ai-sdk/openai-compatible\\\",\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"LM Studio (local)\\\",\\n      \\\"options\\\": {\\n        \\\"baseURL\\\": \\\"http://127.0.0.1:1234/v1\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"models\\\": {\\n\\n        \\\"gpt-oss-20b\\\": {\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"gpt-oss-20b(local)\\\"\\n        },\\n\\n        \\\"Nerdsking/nerdsking-python-coder-3B-i\\\": {\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"nerdsking-python-coder-3B-i(local)\\\"\\n        },\\n\\n        \\\"ethanolivertroy/HackIDLE-NIST-Coder-v1.1-GGUF\\\": {\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"HackIDLE-NIST-Coder-v1.1(local)\\\"\\n        },\\n\\n        \\\"mradermacher/CodeV-SVA-no-think-no-dut-8B-i1-GGUF\\\": {\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"CodeV-SVA-8b(local)\\\"\\n        },\\n\\n        \\\"qwen/qwen3-vl-8b\\\": {\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"qwen3-vl-8b(local)\\\"\\n        },\\n\\n        \\\"nightmedia/Codeforce-metatune-gpt20b-q8-hi-mlx\\\":{\\n          \\\"name\\\":\\\"Codeforce-metatune-gpt20b-q8-hi-mlx(local)\\\"}\\n      }\\n    }\",\"newString\":\"    \\\"lmstudio\\\": {\\n      \\\"npm\\\": \\\"@ai-sdk/openai-compatible\\\",\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"LM Studio (local)\\\",\\n      \\\"options\\\": {\\n        \\\"baseURL\\\": \\\"http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"models\\\": {\\n        \\\"swarm\\\": {\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"SWEN v3 Swarm (distributed)\\\"\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\"}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "tool_oQLW5aF0WS8CIVayFtklWCQl", "content": "Edit applied successfully."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "tool_WesMpwZiOvnNPr0d6vNxwDz4", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "edit", "arguments": "{\"filePath\":\"/Users/alex/.config/opencode/opencode.json\",\"oldString\":\"  \\\"model\\\": \\\"ollama/swarm\\\",\\n  \\\"small_model\\\": \\\"ollama/swarm\\\",\",\"newString\":\"  \\\"model\\\": \\\"lmstudio/swarm\\\",\\n  \\\"small_model\\\": \\\"lmstudio/swarm\\\",\"}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "tool_WesMpwZiOvnNPr0d6vNxwDz4", "content": "Edit applied successfully."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "tool_KEIMKIWJS6xRAMohyMZV7E8F", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "bash", "arguments": "{\"command\":\"# Удаляем ollama провайдер полностью\\ncat ~/.config/opencode/opencode.json | grep -v '\\\"ollama\\\"' > /tmp/opencode_clean.json && mv /tmp/opencode_clean.json ~/.config/opencode/opencode.json\",\"description\":\"Remove ollama provider\"}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "tool_KEIMKIWJS6xRAMohyMZV7E8F", "content": "(no output)"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "tool_Gq9hdIok95S7U7KfGNCQDPe7", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "bash", "arguments": "{\"command\":\"python3 -m json.tool ~/.config/opencode/opencode.json > /dev/null 2>&1 && echo \\\"✅ Valid JSON\\\" || echo \\\"❌ Invalid JSON\\\"\",\"description\":\"Validate config\"}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "tool_Gq9hdIok95S7U7KfGNCQDPe7", "content": "❌ Invalid JSON\n"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "tool_pWBtkz4le66fqxYxLeqh5EDp", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "bash", "arguments": "{\"command\":\"# Восстановим из бэкапа или пересоздадим\\ncat > ~/.config/opencode/opencode.json << 'EOF'\\n{\\n  \\\"$schema\\\": \\\"https://opencode.ai/config.json\\\",\\n  \\\"model\\\": \\\"lmstudio/swarm\\\",\\n  \\\"small_model\\\": \\\"lmstudio/swarm\\\",\\n  \\\"default_agent\\\": \\\"autonomous-swarm\\\",\\n  \\\"provider\\\": {\\n    \\\"lmstudio\\\": {\\n      \\\"npm\\\": \\\"@ai-sdk/openai-compatible\\\",\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"LM Studio (local)\\\",\\n      \\\"options\\\": {\\n        \\\"baseURL\\\": \\\"http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"models\\\": {\\n        \\\"swarm\\\": {\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"SWEN v3 Swarm (distributed)\\\"\\n        }\\n      }\\n    },\\n    \\\"lmstudioA1\\\": {\\n      \\\"npm\\\": \\\"@ai-sdk/openai-compatible\\\",\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"LM Studio (net)\\\",\\n      \\\"options\\\": {\\n        \\\"baseURL\\\": \\\"http://10.15.64.226:1234/v1\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"models\\\": {\\n        \\\"gpt-oss-20b\\\": {\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"gpt-oss-20b(net)\\\"\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n  },\\n  \\\"agent\\\": {\\n    \\\"autonomous-swarm\\\": {\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Autonomous Swarm — fully autonomous distributed AI swarm. No decision-making on opencode side. Simple passthrough: user query → swarm → answer. Swarm handles decomposition, worker selection, judging.\\\",\\n      \\\"mode\\\": \\\"primary\\\",\\n      \\\"permission\\\": {\\n        \\\"edit\\\": \\\"allow\\\",\\n        \\\"bash\\\": \\\"allow\\\",\\n        \\\"read\\\": \\\"allow\\\",\\n        \\\"glob\\\": \\\"allow\\\",\\n        \\\"grep\\\": \\\"allow\\\",\\n        \\\"swen3_ask\\\": \\\"allow\\\",\\n        \\\"swen3_status\\\": \\\"allow\\\"\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\nEOF\",\"description\":\"Recreate clean config\"}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "tool_pWBtkz4le66fqxYxLeqh5EDp", "content": "(no output)"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "tool_4RqCHAjpGng7ueU7FnxmA7nY", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "bash", "arguments": "{\"command\":\"python3 -m json.tool ~/.config/opencode/opencode.json > /dev/null 2>&1 && echo \\\"✅ Valid JSON\\\" || echo \\\"❌ Invalid JSON\\\"\",\"description\":\"Validate config\"}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "tool_4RqCHAjpGng7ueU7FnxmA7nY", "content": "✅ Valid JSON\n"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "tool_pr7ssMmRF8NZSD1JQcyNoW1u", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "bash", "arguments": "{\"command\":\"# Проверяем что gateway всё ещё работает\\ncurl -s http://localhost:8080/health | python3 -m json.tool\",\"description\":\"Check gateway\"}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "tool_pr7ssMmRF8NZSD1JQcyNoW1u", "content": "{\n    \"status\": \"healthy\",\n    \"swarm_connected\": true,\n    \"workers\": [\n        \"glm_flash\",\n        \"qwen3_5_4b_opus\",\n        \"jetson_gemma4b\"\n    ]\n}\n"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Всё готово! Теперь:\n\n1. **Gateway работает** ✅ (порт 8080)\n2. **Конфиг валиден** ✅ \n3. **Модель**: `lmstudio/swarm` (используем существующий провайдер)\n4. **BaseURL**: `http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1` (наш gateway)\n\nПерезапусти opencode:\n```bash\npkill -f opencode\nsleep 2\nopencode\n```\n\nТеперь opencode будет использовать `lmstudio` провайдер но с **нашим endpoint** (порт 8080 вместо 1234).\n\nПопробуй: `сколько будет 5 + 8?`"}, {"role": "user", "content": "привет"}, {"role": "user", "content": "привет"}, {"role": "user", "content": "нет, не работает. а роевой провайдер отвечает на вопросы о доступных моделях как это делает lm studio?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Давай проверим что возвращает наш gateway на `/v1/models` — opencode сначала запрашивает список моделей:", "tool_calls": [{"id": "tool_xqzbe6WulmelxGw0RrMZ4LJS", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "bash", "arguments": "{\"command\":\"curl -s http://localhost:8080/v1/models | python3 -m json.tool\",\"description\":\"Check models endpoint\"}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "tool_xqzbe6WulmelxGw0RrMZ4LJS", "content": "{\n    \"object\": \"list\",\n    \"data\": [\n        {\n            \"id\": \"swarm\",\n            \"object\": \"model\",\n            \"created\": 1777476204,\n            \"owned_by\": \"swen3\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"id\": \"glm_flash\",\n            \"object\": \"model\",\n            \"created\": 1777476204,\n            \"owned_by\": \"swen3\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"id\": \"qwen3_5_4b_opus\",\n            \"object\": \"model\",\n            \"created\": 1777476204,\n            \"owned_by\": \"swen3\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"id\": \"jetson_gemma4b\",\n            \"object\": \"model\",\n            \"created\": 1777476204,\n            \"owned_by\": \"swen3\"\n        }\n    ]\n}\n"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Наш `/v1/models` работает. Но opencode всё равно не работает? Давай проверим что opencode пишет в логи при попытке использовать модель:", "tool_calls": [{"id": "tool_zLP1th8yJdiIH8nT4sHwKvOV", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "bash", "arguments": "{\"command\":\"# Найдем самый свежий лог и посмотрим ошибки\\nlatest_log=$(ls -t ~/.local/share/opencode/log/*.log | head -1)\\necho \\\"=== Latest log: $latest_log ===\\\"\\ngrep -E \\\"lmstudio|swarm|model.*invalid|provider.*error\\\" \\\"$latest_log\\\" | tail -20\",\"description\":\"Check opencode model errors\"}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "tool_zLP1th8yJdiIH8nT4sHwKvOV", "content": "...output truncated...\n\nFull output saved to