tion", "function": {"name": "bash", "arguments": "{\"command\":\"source ~/.venvs/swen3/bin/activate && cd ~/.local/share/swen3 && python3 openai_gateway.py &\",\"description\":\"Start gateway server again\"}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "tool_SsVXnGDrQAdMxUZIAj9SD6Av", "content": "[Old tool result content cleared]"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Сервер запустился но сразу остановился. Проблема в `asyncio.sleep` в `connect_swarm` — нужно использовать `time.sleep` или убрать его. Также нужно проверить коннект к Zenoh.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "tool_P6kaUojo1YyQIT8HSwmaxu6T", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "edit", "arguments": "{\"filePath\":\"/Users/alex/.local/share/swen3/openai_gateway.py\",\"oldString\":\"    swarm_agent = Swen3Agent(cfg)\\n    if not swarm_agent.connect():\\n        raise Exception(f\\\"Cannot connect to swarm: {swarm_agent.status}\\\")\\n    await asyncio.sleep(1)\\n    print(\\\"✅ Connected to SWEN v3 swarm\\\")\",\"newString\":\"    swarm_agent = Swen3Agent(cfg)\\n    if not swarm_agent.connect():\\n        raise Exception(f\\\"Cannot connect to swarm: {swarm_agent.status}\\\")\\n    time.sleep(1)\\n    print(\\\"✅ Connected to SWEN v3 swarm\\\", flush=True)\"}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "tool_P6kaUojo1YyQIT8HSwmaxu6T", "content": "[Old tool result content cleared]"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "tool_EakdB9paAejO6orHbcYTm1YT", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "bash", "arguments": "{\"command\":\"source ~/.venvs/swen3/bin/activate && cd ~/.local/share/swen3 && nohup python3 openai_gateway.py > gateway.log 2>&1 &\",\"description\":\"Start gateway in background\"}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "tool_EakdB9paAejO6orHbcYTm1YT", "content": "[Old tool result content cleared]"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "tool_Es4XD3u1tUAsyeBmAfBYoXhr", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "bash", "arguments": "{\"command\":\"sleep 2 && curl -s http